                  "value": "The data presented here was collected as part of the EMPHASIS project:<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>behavioral.csv:</b>\r\nCSV-file with the behavioural results (response, reaction time) per trial and participant.</li>\r\n<li><b>fixations.csv:</b>\r\nCSV-file with the fixation data (location, duration, etc.) for each trial and participant.</li>\r\n<li><b>saccades.csv:</b>\r\nCSV-file with the saccade data (location, duration, etc.) for each trial and participant.</li>\r\n<li><b>fixation_distance.csv:</b>\r\nCSV-file with the fixation distances to pre-defined AOIs (eyes, nose, mouth, and hands) for each trial and participant.</li>\r\n<li><b>Demographics.csv:</b>\r\nCSV-file with the demographic data of the participants (age, gender)</li><br>"
